OL,3,GNEWSAThe soft play attraction inside a
OL,4,Avillage church
OL,5,
OL,6,FMany rural English villages are losing
OL,7,Ftheir facilities but one in Dorset is
OL,8,Fpositively thriving.
OL,10,FBurton Bradstock, near Bridport, has a
OL,11,Fschool, post office, public toilets,
OL,12,Fnot just one pub but two, and now its
OL,13,Fchurch has installed #20,000 of soft
OL,14,Fplay equipment.
OL,16,FThe money for the new apparatus was
OL,17,Fraised by the parish of St Mary's
OL,18,Fchurch and match-funded by a local
OL,19,Fbrewery.
OL,23,APub: 03-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
